{"name": "The Zibbo Show", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"60\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/972450/extras/c8aac51d2ce878c154360366d10559fe.webp?t=1786530637\" width=\"618\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The lights are on. The audience is going crazy. And tonight, YOU are the star of the show!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Progress through 12 rounds of increasingly dangerous opponents, build a new strategy every run, and face Zibbo himself in the in the grand finale! If you make it that far.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"60\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/972450/extras/b7f7b29ee7875cfb231590acb04d02ed.webp?t=1786530637\" width=\"618\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"240\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/972450/extras/f8314f925c43f92d5f5c6310c3a68678.poster.avif?t=1786530637\" width=\"634\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/972450/extras/f8314f925c43f92d5f5c6310c3a68678.webm?t=1786530637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/972450/extras/f8314f925c43f92d5f5c6310c3a68678.mp4?t=1786530637\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You and your opponent each have a 3\u00d73 board and nine dice. Take turns placing one die at a time. Matching values in a column multiplies your score, and placing the right dice opposite an enemy column destroys their dice. Every placement is a decision full of luck, strategy, and the occasional regret. The crowd loves it either way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Before each match, place a bet. Win and you double it. Lose and it's gone, though honestly, losing the money is the part you'll think about the least.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"60\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/972450/extras/81205affd5e1e65132bda13ea801f502.webp?t=1786530637\" width=\"618\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"240\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/972450/extras/434b4c192653efda8173629018ddba5d.poster.avif?t=1786530637\" width=\"634\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/972450/extras/434b4c192653efda8173629018ddba5d.webm?t=1786530637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/972450/extras/434b4c192653efda8173629018ddba5d.mp4?t=1786530637\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Between matches, visit the shop to collect cards, upgrade your dice, and stock up on chips. Cards trigger automatically and stack in ways you don't always see coming. When the right pieces come together , the score explodes in ways that feel very, very good.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"60\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/972450/extras/66e762312cf6bbbfaaa851b047370d0b.webp?t=1786530637\" width=\"618\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"240\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/972450/extras/4c02025544db678e5a576cf154e41472.poster.avif?t=1786530637\" width=\"634\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/972450/extras/4c02025544db678e5a576cf154e41472.webm?t=1786530637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/972450/extras/4c02025544db678e5a576cf154e41472.mp4?t=1786530637\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every run unlocks new cards to discover and new combinations to try. With 48 cards to collect across runs, there's always something you haven't seen yet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And if things don't go your way tonight? That's what the Spin of Luck is for. Spend a Spin of Luck ticket and you get another shot at the same opponent, with time to revisit the shop and adjust your build.</p> </div>", "short_desc": "Be the star of the most exciting game show on TV! Pick your dice, place your bets, build your combos, and try not to think too hard about what happens when you lose.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/972450/726f492e05a53f7a6d98f9496b4881fc63f241f6/header.jpg?t=1786530637", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Deckbuilding", "Card Game", "Strategy", "3D", "Sci-fi", "Retro"], "developers": "Tessera Studios", "publishers": "Tessera Studios", "release_date": "2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "972450", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "4 May 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/N1VPrmEm4N8", "first_seen": 1777845600.0, "review_rank": 719}